<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Sustainable Toy Production</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Welcome to Our Sustainable Toy Production Project</h1>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#plastic-collection">Plastic Collection & Blockchain</a></li>
        <li><a href="#ai-analysis">AI Plastic Analysis</a></li>
        <li><a href="#toy-design">AI Toy Design & 3D Printing</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section id="plastic-collection">
    <h2>Plastic Collection & Blockchain Integration</h2>
    <p>Plastic waste is collected and tracked using blockchain technology. Each stage of the recycling process is recorded to enhance transparency and prevent fraud.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="ai-analysis">
    <h2>AI-Powered Plastic Analysis</h2>
    <p>AI-driven Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) analyze plastic for safety, ensuring only non-toxic materials are used in toy production.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="toy-design">
    <h2>AI-Driven Toy Design & 3D Printing</h2>
    <p>AI enhances the design process, creating innovative toys through 3D modeling and printing, ensuring high-quality production.</p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Sustainable Toy Project. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

header {
  background-color: #4CAF50;
  color: white;
  padding: 15px;
  text-align: center;
}

header nav ul {
  list-style-type: none;
  padding: 0;
}

header nav ul li {
  display: inline;
  margin: 0 10px;
}

header nav ul li a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
}

h1, h2 {
  color: #333;
}

section {
  padding: 20px;
  margin: 20px 0;
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  background-color: #333;
  color: white;
  padding: 10px;
}

